## PR Description
Resolves #51. Mantle, loam, and aetherling test suites pass on their master branches. Minor changes required to magma to switch `==` to `is` logic. (This one is a bit of a gotcha, basically we can't use `in` statements because those use `__eq__` rather than `is`.)

